# Firebase public config — safe to commit (not secrets, designed to be public)
# Security is enforced by Firestore Rules and Firebase Auth, not by hiding these values.
#
# India project (asia-south1) — canonical since the 2026-07-25 residency migration.
# authDomain must be a Hosting site in THIS project and an authorized domain;
